# Local development only - this file is gitignored and never committed.
# For the deployed site, this same value is stored as a GitHub Actions
# secret named VITE_JSONBIN_ACCESS_KEY (see README.md).
# IMPORTANT: every $ below is escaped as \$ on purpose. This key is a
# bcrypt-style hash containing "$2a$10$", and dotenv's variable-expansion
# feature silently mangles unescaped $ signs (it tries to treat "2a" and
# "10" as variable names to substitute) - even inside quotes. Escaping
# each one is what keeps the key intact.
VITE_JSONBIN_ACCESS_KEY=\$2a\$10\$V2A9j/0g52p4jOjkScpBEu/VKiMkCvKnQqtVkz/fhuRgRCTDmAytK
